  "solution": "Given:\n\n{{1} over 3×4} + {{1} over 4×5} + {{1} over 5×6} + ... + ...............{{1} over 20×21}\n\nCalculation:\n\n{{1} over 3×4} + {{1} over 4×5} + {{1} over 5×6} + ... + ...............{{1} over 20×21}\n\n⇒ {{4 - 3} over 3×4} + {{5 - 4} over 4×5} + {{6 - 5} over 5×6} + ... + {{21 - 20} over 20×21}\n\n⇒ {4 over (3 times 4)} - {3 over (3 times 4)} + {5 over (4 times 5)} - {4 over (4 times 5)} + {6 over (5times 6)} - {5 over (5times 6)} + .... + {21 over (20times 21)} - {20 over (20times 21)}\n\n⇒ {1 over 3} - {1 over 4} + {1 over 4} - {1 over 5} + {1 over 5} + - {1 over 6} + .... - {1 over 20} + {1 over 20} - {1 over 21}\n\n⇒ {1 over 3} - {1 over 21}\n\n⇒ {(7 - 1) over 21}\n\n⇒ {6over 21}\n\n⇒ {2 over 7}\n\n∴ The simplified value is {2 over 7}.",
